      "line_024": {
        "id": "line_024",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "这次我要特别感谢我的一位朋友。没有这位朋友支持我努力走下去，就没有我今日的监听□□□□□□□□□□诡计□□□□□□□□□焚烧□□□□□十字架颂歌□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□海之阴鸷□□□□□□□",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_024:continue"
        },
        "x": 7240,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_025": {
        "id": "line_025",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "我听出来了——这是久已失传的埃里克·赞之曲！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_025:continue"
        },
        "x": 7540,
        "y": 40
      },
